# No API keys are required for Phases 1-10 (Yahoo Finance/FRED/SEC EDGAR
# are all key-free public endpoints). Phase 11 (Alpaca paper-trading
# execution) is the only phase that needs credentials, PAPER account only
# -- see docs/ALPACA_EXECUTION.md.
#
# Variable names match this user's other local Alpaca-integrated projects
# (aurum) so the same .env can be reused across them.
# ALPACA_API_KEY=
# ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=
# ALPACA_BASE_URL=https://paper-api.alpaca.markets
